s-marketplace.mdx","Despliega desde AWS Marketplace","Ejecuta una instancia preconfigurada de Lamassu IoT en Amazon EC2.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/deployment/aws-marketplace",{"_76":428},"deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx",{"_52":430,"_59":69,"_54":431,"_63":432,"_72":-7,"_13":433,"_74":434},"es:deployment/saas.mdx","Utiliza Lamassu como SaaS","Consume Lamassu como servicio gestionado sin operar infraestructura propia.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/deployment/saas",{"_76":435},"deployment/saas.mdx","es:deployment",{"_210":438},"deployment/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/images/kubernetes.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/images/kubernetes.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_59":60,"_54":441,"_61":44,"_62":-7,"_63":442,"_65":-7,"_56":443,"_52":451,"_74":452,"_72":454},"Actualizaciones","Guía de versión a versión para el operador",[444],{"_52":445,"_59":69,"_54":446,"_63":447,"_72":-7,"_13":448,"_74":449},"es:upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","3.8.0 a 4.0.0","Qué cambia en la arquitectura de 4.0.0, qué cambios rompen un despliegue 3.8.0, cómo actualizar paso a paso una release de Helm y cómo validar el resultado.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0",{"_76":450},"upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","es:upgrades",{"_210":453},"upgrades/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-arrow-up shrink-0 text-[#c8861f]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 12-4-4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16V8\"></path></svg>",{"_52":456,"_59":69,"_54":457,"_63":458,"_72":-7,"_13":459,"_74":460},"es:security.mdx","Seguridad","Cómo reportar de forma privada una vulnerabilidad de seguridad en Lamassu, qué inclui